</table>
<p id="A4.SS4.p4.4" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.SS4.p4.4.1" class="ltx_text">where the third, sixth, and ninth lines are by Cauchy-Schwartz inequality and the eighth line is by triangular inequality.</span></p>
</div>
<div id="A4.SS4.p5" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A4.SS4.p5.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.SS4.p5.1.1" class="ltx_text">For <math id="A4.SS4.p5.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="H_{22}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>H</mi><mn>22</mn></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">H_{22}</annotation></semantics></math>,</span></p>
<table id="A4.EGx79" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

