<p id="A4.SS5.p3.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.SS5.p3.3.1" class="ltx_text">Now, notice that by Assumption <a href="#Thmassumption8" title="Assumption 8 (Accuracy of Human Annotations) ‣ 4.1 Assumptions and nonparametric identification ‣ 4 Extension: The Proposed Methodology with Noisy Human Annotations ‣ Surrogate Representation Inference for Text and Image Annotations" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">8</span></a>, I have</span></p>
<table id="A4.EGx101" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

