<p id="A4.I3.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.I3.i2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">(Outcome Model Estimation) Outcome models with an estimated surrogate outcome satisfy</span></p>
